{
    "id":  26604,
    "lang":  "en",
    "name":  "NEW MAYA Single-Phase Track LED Spotlight 28W-40W Bridgelux CRI+92 No Flicker | Bread \u0026 Meat Lighting | Black",
    "reference":  "TLBMBM40W-CCT-91612",
    "short_description":  "\u003cp\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\nNEW MAYA LED Track Spotlight\u003c/strong\u003e for single-phase track, ideal \u003cstrong\u003efor bakeries and butcher shops\u0026nbsp;selectable with\u0026nbsp;Bridgelux COB Chip\u003c/strong\u003e selectable with \u003cstrong\u003eCRI \u0026gt;92\u003c/strong\u003e that enhances the true colour of food such as bread, meat and fresh products. \u003cstrong\u003eGXtronic Driver flicker-free\u003c/strong\u003e for visual comfort. \u003cstrong\u003eAdjustable power 28W-32W-36W-40W\u003c/strong\u003e to adapt to every space. Made of aluminium,\nBlack oven-lacquered finish. Offers high efficiency, durability and professional performance. The perfect solution for food retail LED lighting.\u003cstrong\u003e\n\n\u003c/strong\u003e\n\n\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e",
    "description":  "\u003ch2\u003eNEW MAYA Single-Phase LED Track Spotlight 28-40W Adjustable | COB Bridgelux CRI\u0026gt;92 | GXtronic Driver Flicker-Free | 36º Optic | 5-Year Warranty\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe \u003cstrong\u003eNEW MAYA LED Track Spotlight for single-phase track\u003c/strong\u003e is a high-performance professional lighting solution designed specifically for food retail environments such as \u003cstrong\u003ebakeries, butcher shops and gourmet stores\u003c/strong\u003e. Its advanced technology with a \u003cstrong\u003ehigh-quality Bridgelux COB chip\u003c/strong\u003e and \u003cstrong\u003eCRI \u0026gt;92\u003c/strong\u003e enables exceptional colour rendering, enhancing the true colour of food such as freshly baked bread, fresh meat and delicatessen products, improving the visual perception of the product and boosting the shopping experience.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThis spotlight features \u003cstrong\u003eadjustable power of 28W, 32W, 36W and 40W\u003c/strong\u003e, allowing the light intensity to be adapted to each commercial space without the need to replace luminaires. This flexibility makes it a highly efficient solution for LED retail lighting projects, optimising energy consumption and facilitating the standardisation of installations in different display areas.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eMade of \u003cstrong\u003ehigh-resistance aluminium with a black oven-lacquered finish\u003c/strong\u003e, the NEW MAYA spotlight ensures excellent thermal dissipation, high durability and a professional aesthetic finish in line with demanding commercial projects. Its robust construction guarantees light stability and consistent performance even under intensive daily use.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eIt features a \u003cstrong\u003eflicker-free GXtronic driver\u003c/strong\u003e, which eliminates flicker and significantly improves visual comfort for both customers and employees. This is a key feature in commercial spaces where lighting remains active for long periods, reducing eye strain and improving the overall in-store experience.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eIts \u003cstrong\u003e36º optic\u003c/strong\u003e provides a controlled and precise beam of light, ideal for accent lighting on products, display cases or counters. It also allows selection between \u003cstrong\u003ewarm gold light for bakeries\u003c/strong\u003e or \u003cstrong\u003epink light for butcher shops\u003c/strong\u003e, optimising product presentation according to its category and enhancing its visual appeal on the shelf.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe single-phase track system enables flexible installation, allowing the lighting to be quickly reconfigured as the store layout changes. Its professional design and high performance make it a key tool for lighting projects in supermarkets, specialised shops and food businesses.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eRecommended uses and applications\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eIdeal for commercial lighting projects in:\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eBakeries and artisan bread shops\u003c/strong\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eButcher shops and delicatessens\u003c/strong\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eSupermarkets and food retail\u003c/strong\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eGourmet and delicatessen stores\u003c/strong\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eGreengrocers and local markets\u003c/strong\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eFresh product displays and showcases\u003c/strong\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003ePremium food retailers\u003c/strong\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eLED retail lighting projects\u003c/strong\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003eIn short, the \u003cstrong\u003eNEW MAYA LED Track Spotlight\u003c/strong\u003e is a premium professional lighting solution designed to maximise product presentation, improve the customer experience and increase conversion at the point of sale. Its energy efficiency, excellent colour rendering and flexible power make it a strategic investment with a high return (\u003cstrong\u003eROI\u003c/strong\u003e) for food businesses looking to stand out from the competition.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eIt also includes a \u003cstrong\u003e5-year warranty\u003c/strong\u003e, ensuring reliability and long-term performance in demanding professional installations.\u003c/p\u003e",
